OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Fcontinue to fade through the evening,
OL,7,Fallowing clear skies to develop and
OL,8,Fwinds to briefly ease. However,
OL,9,Fturning increasingly cloudy with winds
OL,10,Fstrengthening again as a band of heavy
OL,11,Frain pushes northeastwards though the
OL,12,Fearly hours. Minimum Temperature 8C.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FA wet and windy start, as a
OL,15,Fband of rain continues to spread
OL,16,Fnortheastwards through much of the
OL,17,Fday, bringing heavy and prolonged
OL,18,Fdownpours. Strong winds persist for
OL,19,Fcoastal regions. Maximum Temperature
OL,20,F14C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
