OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FA
OL,6,Fbrighter day on Monday, though
OL,7,Foccasional blustery showers likely. A
OL,8,Fheavy rain band brings wet and windy
OL,9,Fconditions on Tuesday, with coastal
OL,10,Fgales likely. Turning showery again on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
